{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324540/extras/e42d7ccf759609dd3923dcd381e74af5.poster.avif?t=1747312247\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324540/extras/e42d7ccf759609dd3923dcd381e74af5.webm?t=1747312247\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324540/extras/e42d7ccf759609dd3923dcd381e74af5.mp4?t=1747312247\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through vibrant levels accompanied\u00a0by energetic music, synchronizing your ship's color with flow fields to guide your movement\u00a0while avoiding dangerous obstacles. Stay sharp and don't take the wrong path!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FLOW WITH THE MUSIC</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Color Matching Action:</strong> Switch your ship's color to match and follow the flowing light.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Energetic Music:</strong> A powerful pulse-pounding soundtrack that drives the action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Levels:</strong> Handcrafted stages with escalating challenges and distinct visual styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Replayability:</strong> Enter FURY MODE and push the challenge to the next level!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCOVER SHORTCUTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the hidden paths to cut through the level faster!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324540/extras/9833ecfb20182e7136b2ae3b86287728.poster.avif?t=1747312247\" width=616 height=346 ><so